-- contributor reaches 18, whichever is later, and ends with the earliest of the month before the
-- month in which the contributor reaches 70, the month of death and the month before the retirement
-- pension commences.
`s 49.1 — the last month of the first additional contributory period` `the contributor's date of birth` `the month in which the contributor dies, if the contributor has died` `the month with which the retirement pension commences, if it does` MEANS
    `cp3 — the last month of an additional contributory period` `the contributor's date of birth` `the month in which the contributor dies, if the contributor has died` `the month with which the retirement pension commences, if it does`

