§§ `50, 50.1 and 50.2 -- the totals of pensionable earnings`

-- src:1168 | 50 The total pensionable earnings of a contributor are the total for all months in his contributory period of his pensionable earnings for each month calculated as provided in section 51.
@ref Act s 50 (src:1168)
GIVEN `the pensionable earnings of the contributor for each month in the contributory period, calculated as provided in section 51` IS A LIST OF NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
-- Plain gloss: the total pensionable earnings are the sum of the month-by-month pensionable earnings
-- over the months of the contributory period.
`s 50 — the total pensionable earnings of a contributor` `the pensionable earnings of the contributor for each month in the contributory period, calculated as provided in section 51` MEANS
    sum `the pensionable earnings of the contributor for each month in the contributory period, calculated as provided in section 51`

-- src:1170 | 50.1 The total first additional pensionable earnings of a contributor are the total for all months in their first additional contributory period of their first additional pensionable earnings for each month calculated as provided in section 51.
@ref Act s 50.1 (src:1170)
GIVEN `the first additional pensionable earnings of the contributor for each month in the first additional contributory period, calculated as provided in section 51` IS A LIST OF NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 50.1 — the total first additional pensionable earnings of a contributor` `the first additional pensionable earnings of the contributor for each month in the first additional contributory period, calculated as provided in section 51` MEANS
    sum `the first additional pensionable earnings of the contributor for each month in the first additional contributory period, calculated as provided in section 51`

-- src:1172 | 50.2 The total second additional pensionable earnings of a contributor are the total for all months in their second additional contributory period of their second additional pensionable earnings for each month calculated as provided in section 51.
@ref Act s 50.2 (src:1172)
GIVEN `the second additional pensionable earnings of the contributor for each month in the second additional contributory period, calculated as provided in section 51` IS A LIST OF NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 50.2 — the total second additional pensionable earnings of a contributor` `the second additional pensionable earnings of the contributor for each month in the second additional contributory period, calculated as provided in section 51` MEANS
    sum `the second additional pensionable earnings of the contributor for each month in the second additional contributory period, calculated as provided in section 51`
